#: processes/content/hcert-issuance.bpmn:38
#. Diagram element documentation
#, fuzzy
msgid "Build the COSE Sig_structure from the protected header (alg, kid = SHA-256 of the DSC, first 8 bytes) and the payload, and hand its bytes out to be signed."
msgstr "Construisez la structure COSE Sig_ à partir de l'en-tête protégé (alg, kid = SHA-256 du DSC, premiers 8 octets) et de la charge utile, et remettez ses octets à signer."

